(dd24-what-is-in-the-box)=
# What's in the box

The Duckiedrone box includes all the components needed to build an autonomous drone. Some tools, like the soldering iron, are instead not included in the box and must be otherwise procured. 

```{note}
Duckiedrones, as well as all other Duckietown hardware, is available on the [Duckietown project official shop](https://get.duckietown.com), in particular, the [Duckiedrone](https://get.duckietown.com/products/autonomous-raspberrypi-quadcopter-duckiedrone-dd24?variant=43227749023919). 
```

